Changelog Smart Crafting Table

1.2.14
- Fixed dupe issue when trying to craft items with an almost full inventory
- Shift clicking to craft now only feels available slots in inventory instead of duping results into the world
- Added Russian translation thanks @shaaaaash
- Added Japanese translation thanks @hamu6251ren0725-hue
- Added partial Chinese translation thanks @ZHAY10086

1.2.13
- Config now has the ability to add blocks that are valid for the smart crafting table, this works the same as the tag blocks added here will be valid for the smart crafting table to use

1.2.12
- Added proper FTB Chunks integration, portable smart crafting table can continue to be used within someone else's claimed chunks but any nearby inventories
    will not be accessible to the both the Smart Crafting Table and the Portable Smart Crafting Table
- With this above change the range for the nearby inventories check has been increased to 5 blocks from 3 by default (configurable)

1.2.11
- Fixed Crash on startup

1.2.10
- Added Mouse inputs as valid buttons for opening the smart crafting table

1.2.9
Fixed crashing on server startup

1.2.8
portable Smart Crafting Table can now be opened by pressing c by default
Also now supports curios slots

1.2.7
Fixed Single Chests in certain orientations not being detected as nearby inventories

1.2.6
Smart Crafting now uses a whitelist tag instead of a blacklist tag for nearby inventories
Chests and Barrels are added to the whitelist by default

1.2.5
Updated to neoforge 21.1.203
Can now use @mod to search for recipes from a specific mod

1.2.4
Moved config to bbl/smartcrafting.toml
Now auto updates with server and client environments for curse forge
Fixed double chests counting as two separate inventories and causing duplication bugs
Removed unused methods
Smart Crafting Table now uses items from the player's inventory first before checking nearby inventories

1.2.3
Fixed stonecutter recipe not always consuming the recipe input

1.2.2
Added Portable Smart Crafting Table to the Tools and Utilities tab in the creative menu

1.2.1
Added Portable Smart Crafting Table

1.2.0
Added Config for the range check of both the nearby inventories and stonecutters
Added "smartcrafting:banned_storage" tag to disable blocks with inventories that you do not want the Smart Crafting Table to
    craft from. Furnace, Blast Furnace, Smoker, Brewing Stand are added by default.

1.1.13
Changed favourite to favorite

1.1.12
Mod Sorting button now persists between world loads
Can now favorite recipes by right clicking on the recipe
Favorite recipes will be shown first in the list with a star next to them

1.1.11
Updated Logo
Updated changelog wiki location

1.1.10
Special recipe that extend Crafting Recipes will be removed if there output is empty

1.1.9
Fixed version name

1.1.8
When a recipe is selected that recipe moves to the top right of the list and retains its position whilst it is the selected recipe
Recipe now ordered by name, this can be changed to mod in the Smart Crafting Table gui
Recipe list now changes to show recipe from the selected mod first eg if you select a recipe from ae2, valid ae2 recipes will be shown first,
then normal search for either mod or name carries on

1.1.7
Disabled debug message when clicking
Now connects to inventories around it

1.1.6
Fixed Shift clicking recipe sometimes leaving a leftover item when it should be consumed

1.1.5
Fixed Crashes on server startup

1.1.4
When crafting stonecutter recipes now pays the stonecutter sound

1.1.3
Added JEI into mod dev environment

1.1.2
Remove BBL Core as a dependency
Placing a Stonecutter near allows the smart crafting table to use it in recipes